to leave. At the Nairobi nursery everyone is still in shock after Chippy's death.
在内罗毕的育婴所里，每个人都在奇皮的死后处于震惊状态。

203
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:42,720
So the keepers are using the routine and fun of daily life here to help everyone recover.
因此，看护者们利用这里的日常生活中的规律与乐趣来帮助大家恢复。

204
00:23:42,720 --> 00:24:03,360
But there is some good news. At last, Greece, Strick and Luleini is starting to make friends and join in.
不过也有好消息。终于，希腊人、斯特里克和卢莱尼也开始结交朋友并参与进来。

205
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:11,360
She's certainly has come on a long way from the last few weeks. Just a little while ago she's
与过去几周相比，她确实取得了巨大的进步。就在不久前，她……

206
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:16,720
to stand completely on her own with her trunk hanging low not knowing what to do with herself.
她完全独自一人，身体低垂着，不知道该做什么。

207
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:21,760
She's at least integrating a bit now but she's certainly has times where she still looks very sad.
现在她至少有所适应，但有时她仍然看起来非常悲伤。

208
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:29,280
It will be many years before Luleini is ready to follow in the footsteps of the older orphans
还需要很多年，卢莱尼才能跟上那些年纪较大的孤儿们的脚步

209
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:39,840
and return to the wild. But at least she's making progress and together with the rest of the
然后回归自然。不过至少她正在取得进展，和其他这些婴儿一起，她正在踏上那条漫长而艰难的回归本位的道路。

210
00:24:39,840 --> 00:24:46,320
babies here she's taking her first steps on the long and difficult journey back to where she belongs.
这里的婴儿们正在踏上漫长而艰难的旅程，回到属于它们的地方。

211
00:24:53,920 --> 00:25:00,000
Well it's been an amazing experience to be part of this dysfunctional little elephant family
能成为这个功能失调的小家庭中的一员，真是一次奇妙的经历。

212
